{
  "dashboard_name": "Finance Dashboard Template",
  "source": "analytics",
  "report": "# Finance Dashboard\n\n## Overview\nThis dashboard gives Template finance leaders a unified view of revenue performance, cost posture, and working capital. It supports controllers, finance managers, and FP&A analysts in surfacing cash-flow risks, budget overruns, and collections exposure.\n\n## Key Metrics\n- Total Revenue: P 1,188,000\n- Total Expenses: P 667,000\n- Net Profit: P 521,000\n- ROI: 22%\n- Cash Flow: P 350,000\n- Outstanding Invoices: 14\n\n## Insights\n- Gross margin holds at 44% month-over-month; Marketing spend is the largest single variance driver\n- Outstanding receivables are concentrated in three clients; two are >30 days overdue\n- Payroll remains the largest cost category at 68% of operating spend",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Total Revenue",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Total Revenue", "data_source": "revenue", "module": "Finance", "operation": "sum"}
        ],
        "expected_value": "P 1,188,000"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Total Expenses",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Total Expenses", "data_source": "expenses", "module": "Finance", "operation": "sum"}
        ],
        "expected_value": "P 667,000"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Net Profit",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Net Profit", "data_source": "revenue", "module": "Finance", "operation": "sum"}
        ],
        "expected_value": "P 521,000"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "ROI",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "ROI", "data_source": "revenue", "module": "Finance", "operation": "percentage"}
        ],
        "expected_value": "22%"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Outstanding Invoices",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Outstanding Invoices", "data_source": "invoices", "module": "Finance", "operation": "count", "filters": {"status": "Pending"}}
        ],
        "expected_value": "14"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Cash Flow",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {"name": "Cash Flow", "data_source": "revenue", "module": "Finance", "operation": "sum"}
        ],
        "expected_value": "P 350,000"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "title": "Financial Performance — Income vs Expenses",
      "description": "Monthly comparison of revenue and expenses to surface margin movement.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Finance",
        "data_source": "revenue",
        "group_by": ["category"],
        "fields": ["Product Sales", "Services", "Other Income", "Payroll", "Operations", "Marketing", "Utilities"],
        "aggregation": "sum"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "title": "Cash Flow Trend",
      "description": "Monthly operating cash flow over the last 12 months.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Finance",
        "data_source": "revenue",
        "group_by": ["custom_dates"],
        "date_from": null,
        "date_to": null,
        "date_interval": "monthly",
        "aggregation": "sum"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "pie",
      "title": "Expense Distribution",
      "description": "Share of expenses across core cost categories.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Finance",
        "data_source": "expenses",
        "group_by": ["category"],
        "fields": ["Payroll", "Operations", "Marketing", "Utilities"],
        "aggregation": "sum"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Accounts Receivable",
      "description": "Open receivables with outstanding balance and due date.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Finance",
        "data_source": "receivables",
        "group_by": ["client", "outstanding", "due_date"]
      },
      "column_count": 3,
      "column_width": 200
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Invoice Tracker",
      "description": "All invoices with issue date, due date, amount, and payment status.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Finance",
        "data_source": "invoices",
        "group_by": ["id", "client", "amount", "issue_date", "due_date", "status"]
      },
      "column_count": 6,
      "column_width": 150
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Finance Support Tickets",
      "description": "Open finance/billing tickets needing controller action.",
      "data_config": {
        "module": "Finance",
        "data_source": "tickets",
        "group_by": ["title", "description", "status", "priority"]
      },
      "column_count": 4,
      "column_width": 180
    }
  ]
}
